},{"type":"text","text":", the layout of an Iglu"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"static repository, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"igluctl"},{"type":"text","text":" publishes and Iglu Server takes. It holds the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" writes it, as a self-describing schema: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$schema"},{"type":"text","text":" is Iglu’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"self-describing meta-schema, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"self"},{"type":"text","text":" names the vendor, the event’s name, the format"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"jsonschema"},{"type":"text","text":" and the version, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$id"},{"type":"text","text":", a file name of the plan’s, is left out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Version N of an event is SchemaVer "},{"code":"N-0-0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the version every event of it names: each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version of an event is a breaking change, a SchemaVer MODEL. The newest version of the event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"code":"committed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"N-0-k","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", is compared with the event by what the two mean, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" compares a plan, not by their bytes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When nothing differs, the file returned is the committed one, byte for byte, however it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is formatted.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a difference is breaking ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference\/isBreaking"},{"type":"text","text":"), the export throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/breakingChange(event:version:)"},{"type":"text","text":": a payload the published schema accepts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"could fail the new one, which Iglu publishes only as a new MODEL, so raise the event’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When every difference is compatible (an optional or defaulted property added, a property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removed, a constraint loosened), it is an ADDITION. For ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry\/server","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" the file","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returned is ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-(k+1)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which lists every earlier ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-*","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in ","type":"text"},{"code":"$supersedes","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so Snowplow","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"validates events naming ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" against it; it keeps the properties of ","type":"text"},{"code":"N-0-k","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no longer declares, marked ","type":"text"},{"code":"deprecated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and not required, as ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps them. A static repository doesn’t supersede, so for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry\/staticRepository","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" the export throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/additionNeedsNewVersion(event:version:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" instead.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/invalidVendor"},{"type":"text","text":" for a vendor that isn’t one;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/invalidSchemaKey(event:version:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for an event whose name Iglu doesn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"take or whose version is below 1; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/allOf(event:version:)"},{"type":"text","text":" for a property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of more than one pattern; "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/breakingChange(event:version:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/additionNeedsNewVersion(event:version:)"},{"type":"text","text":" as above; and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError\/fileSystem(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"CocoaError.fileReadCorruptFile","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a newest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"committed version that isn’t a schema the plan wrote."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Throws","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" log "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") in the size of the plan and the registry."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/iglufiles(vendor:registry:carryingforward:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"The plan’s events as the schemas of an Iglu registry of the kind ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registry"},{"text":" under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendor"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one file per event and version: the newest Iglu version of each in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"committed"},{"text":" while it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still describes the event, or the one to publish next.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/IgluExportError":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why a tracking plan couldn’t be written as an Iglu registry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/Tr